{"step_index":609,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-25T12:18:17Z","input_tokens":3370,"cache_read_tokens":129550,"output_tokens":5014,"thinking":"Examining the `renderInteractiveQuiz` function, the goal is to integrate interactive prediction questions before specific program execution steps. The questions cover value predictions after arithmetic operations, boolean condition evaluations, and variable change assessments, supporting active learning. Confirming the implementation ensures accurate prediction prompts are displayed at the appropriate points in the learning sequence.\n\n\nThe function conditionally displays an interactive quiz card based on the quiz mode status and the presence of a quiz question within the current step.  If a question is present and unanswered while autoplay is active, the autoplay is paused. The quiz card renders the question and answer options dynamically, calculating and displaying the current question number relative to the total number of questions.\n\n\nThe function now styles answer options based on correctness and user selection, generating HTML for each button.  Correct answers are highlighted when revealed. Feedback is generated dynamically, including headings and explanations based on answer state.\n\nThe updated rendering logic then constructs the overall quiz card, incorporating answer options and feedback. This includes the feedback box which offers tailored messages based on whether the answer was correct, incorrect, or skipped.\n\n\nThe function now includes logic to determine the actions available to the user, based on whether a prediction has been made. Depending on the scenario, it displays a \"Continue\" button or a \"Skip & Reveal\" option. The quiz card HTML is constructed dynamically, incorporating the header, question, hint, answer options, feedback, and action buttons. Finally, event listeners are attached to the answer option buttons.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"replace_file_content","args":{"AllowMultiple":false,"Description":"Add renderInteractiveQuiz method and call in renderArea2Teaching in app.js","EndLine":885,"Instruction":"Call renderInteractiveQuiz and implement renderInteractiveQuiz method in app.js","ReplacementContent":"    this.teachStepTitle.textContent = lesson.title || step.teacherLesson.title;\n    this.teachCodeBox.innerHTML = this.highlightPythonSyntax(lesson.codeSnippet || step.codeText);\n\n    // Phase 4: Interactive Learning Quiz & Prediction Card (Optional)\n    this.renderInteractiveQuiz(step, currentSubstep);\n\n    // Phase 3: Loop Return Indicator & Loop Array Pointer Tracker\n    this.renderLoopReturnBanner(step, currentSubstep);\n    this.renderVisualLoopStrip(step, currentSubstep);\n\n    // Phase 3: Condition Comparison Gate & Branch Selector\n    this.renderVisualConditionGate(step, currentSubstep);\n\n    // Phase 2: Variable Boxes & Number Movement / Calculation Stage\n    this.renderVisualCalcStage(step, currentSubstep);\n    this.renderNegativeResetVisual(step, currentSubstep);\n\n    // Render Thonny Step-by-Step Expression Evaluator\n    this.renderThonnyExpressionStepper(step);\n\n    // Calculation Breakdown Card\n    if (lesson.calculationCard) {\n      const c = lesson.calculationCard;\n      this.teachCalculationBox.classList.remove(\"hidden\");\n\n      if (c.currentNumber !== null && c.currentNumber !== undefined) {\n        this.calcCurrentNumRow.classList.remove(\"hidden\");\n        this.calcCurrentNumVal.textContent = c.currentNumber;\n      } else {\n        this.calcCurrentNumRow.classList.add(\"hidden\");\n      }\n\n      this.calcBeforeVal.textContent = c.before;\n      this.calcFormulaVal.textContent = c.calculation;\n      this.calcAfterVal.textContent = c.after;\n    } else {\n      this.teachCalculationBox.classList.add(\"hidden\");\n    }\n\n    // Meaning / What is happening\n    const mainMeaning = lesson.whatIsHappening || lesson.whatItMeans;\n    const symbolsNote = lesson.symbolsMeaning && !mainMeaning.includes(lesson.symbolsMeaning)\n      ? `${mainMeaning}<br><br><span style=\"font-size:13.5px; color:var(--text-secondary); display:block; padding-top:4px;\"><strong>Symbols in this step:</strong><br>${lesson.symbolsMeaning}</span>`\n      : mainMeaning;\n    this.teachMeaningText.innerHTML = this.formatMarkdown(symbolsNote);\n\n    // Why is this operation necessary? / Why am I learning this? (Requirement 4)\n    if (this.teachWhySection && this.teachWhyText) {\n      if (lesson.whyNecessary) {\n        this.teachWhySection.classList.remove(\"hidden\");\n        this.teachWhyText.innerHTML = this.formatMarkdown(lesson.whyNecessary);\n      } else {\n        this.teachWhySection.classList.add(\"hidden\");\n      }\n    }\n\n    // Phase 2: Show variables as labeled boxes containing their current values\n    this.renderVisualVariableBoxes(step, currentSubstep);\n\n    this.teachNextText.innerHTML = this.formatMarkdown(lesson.whatHappensNext);\n\n    if (lesson.finalBanner) {\n      this.finalAnswerBanner.classList.remove(\"hidden\");\n      this.finalAnswerHeading.textContent = `Final answer: ${lesson.finalBanner.answer}`;\n      this.finalAnswerDetail.innerHTML = this.formatMarkdown(lesson.finalBanner.summary);\n    } else {\n      this.finalAnswerBanner.classList.add(\"hidden\");\n    }\n  }\n\n  /* =========================================================\n     PHASE 4: INTERACTIVE LEARNING & PREDICTION QUIZ\n     Asks learners to predict outcomes before selected steps:\n     - What will c become after this addition?\n     - Will this condition be True or False?\n     - Will ans change?\n     Reveals correct result and explanation. Feature is optional.\n     ========================================================= */\n  renderInteractiveQuiz(step, currentSubstep) {\n    if (!this.predictQuizCard) return;\n\n    if (!this.quizModeEnabled || !step.quizQuestion) {\n      this.predictQuizCard.classList.add(\"hidden\");\n      this.predictQuizCard.innerHTML = \"\";\n      return;\n    }\n\n    const q = step.quizQuestion;\n    const answerState = this.quizAnswers.get(step.stepIndex);\n    const isAnswered = Boolean(answerState && answerState.answered);\n\n    // If Auto Play is running and an unanswered question appears, pause Auto Play so learner can answer!\n    if (this.isPlaying && !isAnswered) {\n      this.stopAutoPlay();\n    }\n\n    this.predictQuizCard.classList.remove(\"hidden\");\n\n    const totalQuestions = (this.traceResult.steps || []).filter((s) => Boolean(s.quizQuestion)).length;\n    const currentQNum = (this.traceResult.steps || [])\n      .slice(0, step.stepIndex + 1)\n      .filter((s) => Boolean(s.quizQuestion)).length;\n\n    const scoreDisplay =\n      this.quizScore.total > 0\n        ? `Score: ${this.quizScore.correct}/${this.quizScore.total} (${Math.round(\n            (this.quizScore.correct / this.quizScore.total) * 100\n          )}%) ⭐`\n        : `Question ${currentQNum} of ${totalQuestions}`;\n\n    // Options rendering\n    const optionsHTML = q.options\n      .map((opt, idx) => {\n        let btnClass = \"quiz-option-btn\";\n        let tagHTML = \"\";\n\n        if (isAnswered) {\n          const isSelected = answerState.selectedIdx === idx;\n          if (isSelected) {\n            if (answerState.isCorrect) {\n              btnClass += \" is-correct\";\n              tagHTML = `<span class=\"quiz-option-tag tag-correct\">✓ Your Answer</span>`;\n            } else {\n              btnClass += \" is-wrong\";\n              tagHTML = `<span class=\"quiz-option-tag tag-wrong\">✗ Your Answer</span>`;\n            }\n          } else if (opt.isCorrect) {\n            btnClass += \" is-revealed-correct\";\n            tagHTML = `<span class=\"quiz-option-tag tag-correct\">✓ Correct Answer</span>`;\n          }\n        }\n\n        return `\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"${btnClass}\" data-idx=\"${idx}\" ${isAnswered ? \"disabled\" : \"\"}>\n            <span>${this.escapeHTML(opt.text)}</span>\n            ${tagHTML}\n          </button>\n        `;\n      })\n      .join(\"\");\n\n    let feedbackBoxHTML = \"\";\n    if (isAnswered) {\n      const feedbackHeading = answerState.skipped\n        ? \"<strong>Result & Explanation Revealed:</strong>\"\n        : answerState.isCorrect\n        ? \"<strong>🎉 Excellent Prediction!</strong>\"\n        : \"<strong>💡 Good Try! Here is how it works:</strong>\";\n\n      feedbackBoxHTML = `\n        <div class=\"quiz-explanation-box\">\n          <div style=\"margin-bottom: 4px;\">${feedbackHeading}</div>\n          <div>${this.formatMarkdown(q.explanation)}</div>\n        </div>\n      `;\n    }\n\n    let actionsHTML = \"\";\n    if (isAnswered) {\n      actionsHTML = `\n        <div class=\"quiz-actions-row\">\n          <span style=\"font-size:12.5px; color:#6d28d9; font-weight:600;\">Prediction recorded! Inspect the execution flow below.</span>\n          <button type=\"button\" id=\"btnQuizContinue\" class=\"btn-quiz-continue\">\n            Continue Step ➔\n          </button>\n        </div>\n      `;\n    } else {\n      actionsHTML = `\n        <div class=\"quiz-actions-row\">\n          <span style=\"font-size:12px; color:var(--text-muted);\">Pick your prediction above or skip to reveal immediately:</span>\n          <button type=\"button\" id=\"btnQuizSkip\" class=\"btn-quiz-skip\">Skip & Reveal</button>\n        </div>\n      `;\n    }\n\n    this.predictQuizCard.innerHTML = `\n      <div class=\"quiz-header-row\">\n        <span class=\"quiz-badge\">🎯 ${this.escapeHTML(q.title || \"Interactive Prediction\")}</span>\n        <span class=\"quiz-score-pill\">${this.escapeHTML(scoreDisplay)}</span>\n      </div>\n      <h3 class=\"quiz-question-title\">${this.escapeHTML(q.question)}</h3>\n      ${q.hint ? `<p class=\"quiz-hint-text\"><strong>Context:</strong> ${this.escapeHTML(q.hint)}</p>` : \"\"}\n      <div class=\"quiz-options-grid\">\n        ${optionsHTML}\n      </div>\n      ${feedbackBoxHTML}\n      ${actionsHTML}\n    `;\n\n    // Bind option click handlers if unanswered\n    if (!isAnswered) {\n      const optionButtons = this.predictQuizCard.querySelectorAll(\".quiz-option-btn\");\n      optionButtons.forEach((btn) => {\n        btn.addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n          const idx = Number(btn.getAttribute(\"data-idx\"));\n          const selectedOpt = q.options[idx];\n          if (!selectedOpt) return;\n\n          const isCorrect = Boolean(selectedOpt.isCorrect);\n          this.quizScore.total++;\n          if (isCorrect) {\n            this.quizScore.correct++;\n          }\n\n          this.quizAnswers.set(step.stepIndex, {\n            selectedIdx: idx,\n            isCorrect,\n            answered: true,\n            skipped: false\n          });\n\n          this.renderStep();\n        });\n      });\n\n      const btnSkip = this.predictQuizCard.querySelector(\"#btnQuizSkip\");\n      if (btnSkip) {\n        btnSkip.addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n          this.quizAnswers.set(step.stepIndex, {\n            selectedIdx: -1,\n            isCorrect: false,\n            answered: true,\n            skipped: true\n          });\n          this.renderStep();\n        });\n      }\n    } else {\n      const btnContinue = this.predictQuizCard.querySelector(\"#btnQuizContinue\");\n      if (btnContinue) {\n        btnContinue.addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n          this.goToNextSubstep();\n        });\n      }\n    }\n  }\n\n  /* PHASE 3: Visually Return to the Loop when another iteration begins */\n  renderLoopReturnBanner(step, currentSubstep) {","StartLine":814,"TargetContent":"    this.teachStepTitle.textContent = lesson.title || step.teacherLesson.title;\n    this.teachCodeBox.innerHTML = this.highlightPythonSyntax(lesson.codeSnippet || step.codeText);\n\n    // Phase 3: Loop Return Indicator & Loop Array Pointer Tracker\n    this.renderLoopReturnBanner(step, currentSubstep);\n